# Everything the image never needs. Keeping secrets out is the point of the first block: a .env copied
# into an image layer is a key on disk in every registry that holds the image (D-AWS7).
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
docs/psp-docs/

**/node_modules
**/dist
.git
.github
.claude
graphify-out
docs
apps/driver/android
apps/driver/ios
DESIGN-IS-*
tools/mcleod-agent/node_modules
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
